<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>quintal · página não encontrada</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: #faf6f1;
        color: #2e2833;
        font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
        text-align: center;
      }
      main { max-width: 32rem; padding: 2rem; }
      img { width: 10rem; height: auto; }
      a { color: #8b7bb8; }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        body { background: #1d1923; color: #e8e2ee; }
        a { color: #a493cc; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <img src="/images/axo-with-glass.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
      <p>o axô procurou, procurou... e não achou essa página</p>
      <p><a href="/">voltar pro quintal</a></p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
